stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> NotLipsing

    state "Lipsing: No" as NotLipsing
    state "Lipsing: Yes" as Lipsing
    state "Building up" as Building
    state "Fading out" as Fading

    NotLipsing --> Building : frame is active<br/>(open OR moving)
    Building --> Building : still active<br/>streak < 3
    Building --> Lipsing : streak reaches 3
    Building --> NotLipsing : frame not active<br/>streak resets to 0
    NotLipsing --> Lipsing : mouthOpen > 0.35<br/>(instant-on shortcut)

    Lipsing --> Fading : frame not active
    Fading --> Fading : still not active<br/>streak < 3
    Fading --> NotLipsing : streak reaches 3
    Fading --> Lipsing : frame active again<br/>streak resets to 0

    Lipsing --> Fading : no face detected
    Building --> NotLipsing : no face detected<br/>history cleared

    note right of Building
        Hysteresis: the displayed
        answer only changes after
        3 frames in a row agree.
        This is what stops the
        label flickering.
    end note
